&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Landor is looking for a Senior Motion Designer to join our London studio. Could this be you? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are Landor, part of WPP&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;World-leading brand experts,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;underpinned by the most expansive strategic &amp;amp; creative capabilities in our category.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We make brands more valuable and less vulnerable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We build brands differently. We work with our clients to define and solve their business problems through the lens of brand. We strategically join the dots between our design, experience, governance and measurement capabilities, and always connect our brand work to business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Landor companies also include amp (sonic branding), bdg (workplace &amp;amp; architectural experts), Deep Local (creative technologists) and ManvsMachine (3D motion design).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;WPP.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Senior 3D Motion Designer, you’ll be our resident 3D specialist, driving intelligent and refreshingly different motion design across all brands within Landor. You will be responsible for bringing brand systems to life through high-impact visual effects, particle physics, and photorealistic 3D animation—swinging effortlessly from client work to high-stakes pitches. In this role, you will take ownership of your own workload, projects, and client interactions, managing timelines and presenting concepts with confidence. You’ll collaborate closely with our Design Directors and creative teams, combining technical craft with bold storytelling to push our work into new dimensions, while keeping the studio inspired by discovering and sharing the latest sources of creative and technical stimuli.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring deep experience in 3D motion design within a fast-paced agency or studio environment, supported by a portfolio or showreel that demonstrates conceptual thinking, versatility, and technical mastery. You&#39;ll be comfortable managing your own workload, leading project pipelines, and building strong relationships with clients and internal teams alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key skills and tools required include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in&amp;nbsp;Houdini&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Cinema 4D&amp;nbsp;(or Maya/3ds Max), with a strong focus on advanced&amp;nbsp;pack and particle simulations, fluid dynamics, and complex material rendering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills across the Adobe Creative Suite, particularly After Effects, Photoshop, and Illustrator.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in managing end-to-end 3D motion projects, from initial concept and storyboarding to final render and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing client conversations, pitching motion concepts, and guiding broader project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong art direction and an eye for how motion integrates into global brand identity systems and physical/digital touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organization and time management, with the ability to handle tight deadlines, navigate changing priorities, and keep cool under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Being adaptable, collaborative, open to direction, and passionate about mentoring others will help you thrive in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We build brands. We build futures. Landor, a WPP company, is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics, committed to a culture of respect where everyone belongs and can progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI #LI-DNP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to On! As one of the world’s fastest-growing premium sportswear brands, we’re redefining performance through pioneering technology, bold innovation, and a commitment to sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Specialist - Campaign Production, EMEA, you will turn creative vision into physical reality across the region. You will bridge high-concept spatial design with master-class production logistics, translating global stories into high-impact regional executions across all retail and brand touchpoints. This role will drive our operational shift toward proactive campaign planning, strategic vendor integration, and flawless retail store elevation—ensuring On remains the most premium and culturally resonant brand across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are On’s &lt;strong&gt;Brand Experience, EMEA team&lt;/strong&gt;, united by a clear mission to create the most memorable brand experiences and spark our communities. Shaping our brand interaction across the region – defining how we show up and engage with our communities across all touchpoints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the EMEA Retail Marketing team who translate and execute On’s global retail brand strategy across all EMEA retail channels (B2B, DTC, DMS, and Distributor), ensuring alignment with local market dynamics and regional marketing initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together, we operate as a high-trust, collaborative network. We champion inclusivity and creativity, united by a shared belief that movement has the power to inspire people to dream big and go further. You aren&#39;t just joining a department; you are joining a community dedicated to making On the most culturally resonant brand in the market where it all began.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spearhead End-to-End Campaign Production:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the execution lifecycle for regional campaign builds, managing technical site surveys, blueprint translation, supplier sourcing, and final on-site installation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Strategic Budget Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage and optimize the EMEA campaign production budget, balancing cost efficiency, regional scale, and uncompromised premium design output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate High-Performing Vendor Networks:&lt;/strong&gt; Audit, expand, and manage regional supplier and production agency relationships to ensure seamless delivery, operational agility, and high execution standards across Europe, the GCC, and Africa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge Global Concept to Regional Reality:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with Global Studios and EMEA Campaign Designers to adapt global storytelling into locally resonant, technically sound physical installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate Retail Environments: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the regional rollout of On’s &quot;Blueprints&quot; initiative, elevating key doors, pop-up concepts, and permanent retail spaces through innovative production solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;: Establish scalable production processes, standardizing quality control, logistics workflows, and cross-functional handoffs between retail marketing, commercial teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR STORY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typically we look for around 5 years of relevant retail/campaign production experience. &lt;/strong&gt;Previous experience across premium or large scale brands that have gone through large expansions is valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Production &amp;amp; Spatial Execution Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading multi-site retail campaign production, 3D spatial installations, or visual merchandising production across complex, international environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferably you bring Technical 3D Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience working with 3D design software (e.g., SketchUp, AutoCAD, or vector tools) to review blueprints, audit spatial layouts, and guide technical production builds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Channel Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience producing physical brand activations across varied business models, including owned retail (DTC), franchise, wholesale, or B2B touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong cross-functional management&lt;/strong&gt; - You’re comfortable navigating different business models and influencing a wide network of stakeholders to deliver cohesive, elevated retail experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
