&lt;p&gt;Welcome to On! As one of the world’s fastest-growing premium sportswear brands, On is making waves globally in footwear, apparel, and accessories through pioneering technology, bold innovation, and a commitment to sustainability. Having already inspired millions of runners worldwide, we are now seeking a Senior Specialist for B2B Retail Development to serve as the primary point of contact on our JD, Footlocker &amp;amp; Snipes key youth accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior Specialist - B2B Retail Development (EMEA), you will turn strategic brand vision into elevated physical retail experiences. You will own the presentation of On’s Shop-in-Shops (SIS) and branded environments across key wholesale partners (including JD, Foot Locker, and Snipes), ensuring every touchpoint reflects our premium identity. Bridging global strategy with regional execution, you will lead high-impact fixture rollouts, optimize retail workflows, and shape the physical consumer journey across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
