&lt;li&gt;You are a &lt;strong&gt;systems thinker&lt;/strong&gt;: you reason about how components interact - data flow, failure modes, cost, and operational behavior - not just how a single feature works in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism and short feedback loops.&lt;/strong&gt; You break complex problems into increments: analyze, design, deliver an MVP, learn, iterate. You are able to design a solution, get feedback, and write a prototype by yourself - the ability to work on your own is crucial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a good understanding of &lt;strong&gt;a software development process that takes a user-centered approach&lt;/strong&gt;. You easily build an understanding of the users&#39; context and goals which will help you build the right solution with the maximum value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use &lt;strong&gt;AI tools as a natural part of your engineering workflow&lt;/strong&gt; - whether for accelerating exploration, code review, or reasoning through design tradeoffs - and you&#39;re thoughtful about where they help and where they don&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or operating multi-tenant SaaS systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools (Grafana, Datadog, New Relic, Sentry, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with k6, Playwright, or browser automation at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or maintaining open source projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In Germany, the Base compensation range for this role is EUR 76&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;,000&lt;/span&gt; - EUR 95&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;,000&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp; Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process. Benefits include equity, bonus (if applicable) and other benefits listed &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/about/careers/#jobs&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
